cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Floccus: PRISMA-compliant LLM-assisted screening pipeline for systematic literature reviews on biological floc dynamics"
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite the accompanying manuscript and this software entry."
type: software
# Software authorship is credited separately from authorship of the
